    <!-- About Page -->
    <string name="about_title">About PocketDev</string>
    <string name="about_version_text">Version 2.1 • Real Stdio LSP, Build/Run, GitHub &amp; Zsh (robbyrussell)</string>
    <string name="about_subtitle">Modern mobile IDE with Sora Editor syntax highlighting, real ProcessBuilder stdio LSP client, 1-tap Compile/Run into Build Output, GitHub OAuth/PAT integration, and an Ubuntu 24.04 Zsh (robbyrussell) terminal.</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">• Real Stdio LSP Client &amp; Code Intelligence: ProcessBuilder-driven JSON-RPC 2.0 loop for installed language servers plus Hover documentation, Go-to-Definition, Find-References, Symbol Rename refactoring, and Diagnostics count badges.\n• Compile/Run &amp; Document Formatting: Run Go, Python, Node, TypeScript, Java, Kotlin, Rust, C/C++, PHP, Lua, and Shell scripts with streaming Build Output and per-language Run Configurations, plus clang-format/prettier/gofmt formatting.\n• Editor Productivity: Word-match highlighting under cursor, Code Folding ranges, and VS Code-style Sticky-Scroll top-level block headers.\n• GitHub Integration: OAuth Device Flow &amp; Personal Access Token login, private/public repository cloner, commit/push/pull dialogs, branch switcher, unified diff viewer, and M/A/U/D git-status badges in the File Tree.\n• Ubuntu 24.04 PRoot + Zsh (robbyrussell): Instant command execution, persistent warm PRoot shell, auto wake-lock management, toggle-sticky Ctrl key, notification shade download progress, and offline .tar.gz Environment Backup/Restore.</string>
